50
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:28,000
Few writers have influenced queer vocabulary so dramatically without completing the necessary paperwork.

51
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:37,000
Yet, reconstructing Safo's personal life is difficult. Most of her work survives in fragments. Scholars debate the settings, performers, and social

52
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:44,000
