58
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Adult equality mattered less than role, status, and reputation.

59
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Women's relationships are dimly recorded. Marriage between citizen men was not an available institution. Family

60
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:37,000
