120
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:58,000
The slave was accepted. The family tree remained mandatory.

121
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:05,000
Ancient India complicates the map even further. Indian traditions contain stories of changing sex, combining

122
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:14,000
