163
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Compared with Greece or Han China, the archive is thinner and more ambiguous.

164
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:41,000
This raises the deepest problem in the entire question. History preserves visibility unevenly. Elite men wrote about elite men. Courts recorded rulers.

165
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Laws recorded disputes. Satists recorded whatever could embarrass someone.

166
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:54,000
