183
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:10,000
Ancient Indian traditions recognized third nature people, gender transformation and samesex practices,

184
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:15,000
though recognition varied and did not guarantee equality.

185
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:24,000
Mesopotamian religions made space for gender crossing roles, while law and social hierarchy placed boundaries around male sex.

186
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:31,000
